text = "Welcome to The Void. 

The original game was meant to be for the GGG game jam,
but due to scheduling issues it was unable to be entered.
As of currently, this only has one level. 
There are two routes to this level.

The script for the next three levels has been written. 
Much improvements would be made then to this game.
Feel free to provide feedback kindly. Thank you for playing!

Known bugs: eyery would sometimes have collision errors. 
This is due to a delay with the collision or collision layers triggering
when it was not supposed to."
horizontal_alignment = 1

